{"unit_id":"kiligzzz__dsh-session-nav#feature-1","repo":"kiligzzz/dsh-session-nav","commit":"15d65ff0758c5d72bab225ee39e08bbb2a62b2bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-nav 的功能「历史消息导航」：为会话中的用户消息各显示一个侧边钢琴键，覆盖已读取的完整历史并与当前窗口合并。点击键可定位已加载消息；较早消息会触发分页加载后再跳转。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-82","lib/client.js:481-564","lib/client.js:900-961"]}
{"unit_id":"kiligzzz__dsh-session-nav#feature-2","repo":"kiligzzz/dsh-session-nav","commit":"15d65ff0758c5d72bab225ee39e08bbb2a62b2bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-nav 的功能「回合悬停预览」：鼠标悬停在某个导航键上时，气泡显示对应用户消息和模型回复，并标注回合序号；回复文本会截短以适配预览。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1037-1057","lib/shared.js:34-52"]}
{"unit_id":"kiligzzz__dsh-session-nav#feature-3","repo":"kiligzzz/dsh-session-nav","commit":"15d65ff0758c5d72bab225ee39e08bbb2a62b2bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-nav 的功能「当前消息提示」：滚动对话时，导航条根据可见消息行更新当前位置，并用颜色标出当前对应的键；导航簇会在消息区域内垂直居中排列。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:612-696","lib/shared.js:64-90"]}
{"unit_id":"kiligzzz__dsh-session-nav#feature-4","repo":"kiligzzz/dsh-session-nav","commit":"15d65ff0758c5d72bab225ee39e08bbb2a62b2bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-nav 的功能「按视图显示导航」：钢琴键仅在 DSH 对话视图且消息区域未被弹窗遮挡时出现；主题样式会根据 DSH 深色标记或系统配色偏好更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:191-203","lib/client.js:211-245","lib/client.js:612-617","lib/client.js:845-863"]}
